### 1. Privacy considerations for monitoring of personnel (GDPR / employment law compliance)
<<SHOULD item:A.7.4:privacy_balance>>
_Why: Legal balance_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## Revision history
<<REVISION_HISTORY>>
', 'req__A_7_4__physical_security_monitoring.md', 6, 1, '2026-08-09 12:24:34.699322+00', 'load_to_postgres.py');
