<<MUST item:A.7.6:escort_third_parties>>
_Why: 27002:7.6 — security measures_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## 4. Clean entry/exit (search procedure if classification warrants, sign-out of materials)
<<MUST item:A.7.6:clean_entry_exit>>
_Why: 27002:7.6 — designed and implemented_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## 5. Vacant-area rules (lock-out, alarm activation, last-person-out checklist)
<<MUST item:A.7.6:vacant_rules>>
_Why: Off-hours risk_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## 6. Work-permit system for non-routine activities (maintenance, cleaning, visitors with extended access)
<<MUST item:A.7.6:work_permits>>
_Why: Operational control_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
