<<MUST item:Art.41:procedures>>
_Why: Art.41.2.c-d_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## 5. COI management (Art.41.2.e)
<<MUST item:Art.41:coi_management>>
_Why: Art.41.2.e_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## Recommended additions
