## What this template gives you
This template helps you document how your organization supports customers in meeting their privacy rights obligations, including technical assistance, information sharing, and contract-specific support details.
## When to use it
Use this procedure whenever your organization is required to help customers comply with subject-rights requests, and update it whenever there are changes in your support processes or contractual commitments.
## Prerequisites
<<PREREQUISITES>>
## Cross-references
<<CROSS_REFERENCES>>
## Estimated effort
Expect to spend about 50 to 75 minutes completing this from scratch, as you''ll need to cover five required elements in detail.
## 1. Technical support paths — APIs / features / configuration to fulfil rectification, erasure, portability, restriction
<<MUST item:B.8.3.1:proc_technical_support>>
_Why: §8.3.1 — technical measures to facilitate_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## 2. Informational support — customer can request info about processing (as processor''s records permit) to inform Art.15 responses
