# Vulnerability Backlog Register
<<DOC_CONTROL>>
> Per-finding tracking — CVE / finding id, affected asset, severity, remediation SLA, status. Drives ''show me all critical vulnerabilities and how long they''ve been open''
<!-- TABLE-COLUMNS leaf:req:A.8.8:vulnerability_backlog_register -->
<!-- column: item:A.8.8:reg_finding_id -->
