## What this template gives you
This template helps you keep a clear record of all known vulnerabilities in your systems, including details like severity, affected assets, and how long issues have been open. It''s ideal if you need to track and report on security findings efficiently.
## When to use it
Use this register at all times to document and monitor vulnerabilities in your environment, updating it whenever new findings arise or statuses change. Refresh the information as needed to ensure accuracy and compliance.
## Prerequisites
<<PREREQUISITES>>
## Cross-references
<<CROSS_REFERENCES>>
## Estimated effort
Expect to spend about 10-15 minutes per required detail for each vulnerability you record. The total time depends on how many findings you need to enter, so initial setup may take an hour or more if you have several open issues.
## Register
Fill one row per record. Each column maps to a MUST item the auditor will check — empty columns count as unsatisfied. Add as many rows as you need.
