<<MUST item:6.3:scope_a832_boundary>>
_Why: Cross-control coherence_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## 3. Threshold rules (when a change is ''significant'' enough to need 6.3 planning)
<<MUST item:6.3:scope_thresholds>>
_Why: Defensible bounding_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## Recommended additions
_The items below strengthen the artefact but are not strictly required for the MUST checks. Fill in any that apply to your environment._
### 1. Grey-area decisions captured (e.g. major tooling change with process implications)
<<SHOULD item:6.3:scope_grey_areas>>
_Why: Operational clarity_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## Revision history
<<REVISION_HISTORY>>
', 'req__6_3__applicable_change_types_scope.md', 3, 1, '2026-08-09 12:24:34.699322+00', 'load_to_postgres.py');
