<<GUIDANCE>>
### Rec Post Close Review
<<SHOULD item:A.5.11:rec_post_close_review>>
_Why: Continual assurance_
> _Standard text:_ Post-closure verification window noted (e.g. 30-day check that no stale access reappears)
<<GUIDANCE>>
