<<MUST item:A.5.3:approval_date>>
_Why: Clause 5.3_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## 3. Reference to the specific version of the segregation matrix being approved
<<MUST item:A.5.3:approval_target>>
_Why: Accountability_
<<GUIDANCE>>
<<TEXT>>
## Recommended additions
