### Log Siem Correlation
<<SHOULD item:A.8.2:log_siem_correlation>>
_Why: Detection maturity_
> _Standard text:_ SIEM correlation rules tuned for privileged-access misuse patterns
<<GUIDANCE>>
## Revision history
<<REVISION_HISTORY>>
