<<GUIDANCE>>
### Rev Access Audit
<<MUST item:Art.10:rev_access_audit>>
_Why: Art.10_
> _Standard text:_ Access audit — restricted-access requirements being enforced (no broad access to criminal-data stores)
<<GUIDANCE>>
