## What this template gives you
This template helps you formally appoint an EU-based representative if your organization is outside the EU but handles personal data of people in the EU. It ensures you meet GDPR requirements for representation.
## When to use it
Use this document if your business is not established in the EU but offers goods or services to, or monitors, individuals in the EU. Update it whenever your representative or business details change.
## Prerequisites
<<PREREQUISITES>>
## Cross-references
<<CROSS_REFERENCES>>
## Estimated effort
Expect to spend about 60 to 75 minutes to complete this document from scratch, as each required section takes around 10 to 15 minutes to fill in.
